### Feature Users — GET (JWT + RBAC)
@baseUrl = http://localhost:4000
# access_token: npm run dev:token -- admin  (o POST /api/sesion/login desde ISS-15)
@token = pega-aqui-el-access-token

### Listar usuarios activos
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/usuarios
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Obtener usuario
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/usuarios/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### id inválido → 400
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/usuarios/abc
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
